    <item>
      <title>Lisbon, Portugal</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/now/2025-08-29_lisbon/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 29 Aug 2025 06:41:12 -0400</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/now/2025-08-29_lisbon/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-im-doing-right-now&#34;&gt;What I&amp;rsquo;m doing &lt;span class=&#34;title-em&#34;&gt;right now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;now-page-meta&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Location &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;📌&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;Lisbon, Portugal&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Timezone &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;🕓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;European Summer Time&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Last Updated &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;⌛&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;August 29th, 2025&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;globeViz&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;a-quick-visit-to-new-york-city&#34;&gt;A quick visit to New York City&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;crossing-the-atlantic-by-boat&#34;&gt;Crossing the Atlantic by boat&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;On July 8th, we boarded the Queen Mary 2 for a 6 day journey across the Atlantic Ocean to Southampton, England.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;queen-mary.jpg&#34; title=&#34;abc&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 635px; border: 8px solid #FFF;&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p class=&#34;cap&#34;&gt;Back porch views in Canton, NC&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;were-in-lisbon-for-the-summer&#34;&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re in Lisbon for the summer&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;After 6 days at sea on the Queen Mary 2, and a very brief stop in London, Briana and I arrived in Lisbon for the summer.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Canton, NC</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/now/2024-06-22_canton/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 09:00:00 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/now/2024-06-22_canton/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-im-doing-right-now&#34;&gt;What I&amp;rsquo;m doing &lt;span class=&#34;title-em&#34;&gt;right now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;now-page-meta&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Location &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;📌&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;Canton, NC&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Timezone &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;🕓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;Eastern Standard&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;meta-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;label&#34;&gt;Last Updated &lt;span class=&#34;emoji&#34;&gt;⌛&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;property&#34;&gt;June 21st, 2024&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&#34;globeViz&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;canton-nc-has-become-our-home-base&#34;&gt;Canton, NC has become our home base&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p style=&#34;max-width: 530px;&#34;&gt;Since 2018, Briana and I have lived just about everywhere within a 30 mile radius of Asheville, North Carolina - small towns like Barnardsville, Mars Hill, Weaverville, Black Mountain, Swannanoa, Fletcher, and a handful of other places.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In September of 2023, we came 20 miles west of Asheville to Canton. We found a beautiful place with a flexible renting arrangement that still allows us to travel, and we plan to stick around as long as they&#39;ll have us (or until we buy a place of our own).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
